					"why": "y\\vec{AC} = 2y\\vec{AE}，x + 2y = 1。", "hint": "\\vec{AC} 是幾倍的 \\vec{AE}？"}},
				{"title": "斜坐標的區域", "decoys": ["> 1", "x − y"], "tag": "方法", "glyph": "△",
